    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4335c2fa18e0c9ca3b9c382b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "早安。你吃早餐了吗？\r\n我推荐吃纳豆饭，\r\n那对身体很好喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "d728d4734c1ee147868818853972e7a9684ab1cdaacdb3ae3b7b3c6e7905d25b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "90000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1100/90000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e87b8b6f17a107cb6f8b976",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哎呀，你看起来好像很困呢～\r\n我给你一颗糖果提神吧。\r\n是清凉的薄荷口味喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "53972498967bbb74ebc2572344508913186a95fca6b3ad0c06eeef61681563f9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "90001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1100/90001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3728316179d0985645bf0ab3",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小历经常在午餐时间告诉我\r\n有哪些「开运菜色」，\r\n让我学到了很多呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "53bfdddfc8918c54a669141249477d6992f69ebce14a690d1dad69090807075b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "90002"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1100/90002"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b3d76ddcebc150cf1e0ef24",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你很努力工作呢～\r\n要不要吃点饼干当点心？\r\n这样下午就能充满精神地训练了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac77556f556e2c6299c9f93561bffde13136f5248d5647ebf2849dbe02c1126c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "90003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1100/90003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79d52a3c8b2334e5f9e58a14",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你晚上会不会听见不晓得\r\n从哪里传来的奇妙声音呢？\r\n那说不定是鵺呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "e48c4808c5fa7152d87120c4fe2a304241a76d80da9a956c66eec84987724ac9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "90004"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1100/90004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91807041b9f8d6050051173b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哎呀，你还在工作啊。\r\n那我也来做重训吧。\r\n只要一起努力，力量也会加倍呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "85ed8deacf8d58e0a2b54c2a1324befc5d8c5efa96a03ac7eb4183795c4559ef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "90005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1100/90005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9a81fe0c9d2f21b0aaa2b7b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "春天的阳光暖呼呼的真是舒服～\r\n好想在庭园里悠闲～地做串珠呀～",
      "source_fingerprint": "adf2d644ebbbe58a40c41f68d92f0aceead1809060bd5d8707c445dcda5ad147",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "90006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1100/90006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cd4dff553b20f1e73864454",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏天会让人很想吃冰凉的东西呢～\r\n为了避免大家的肚肚着凉，\r\n我来替大家织肚围吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "13feb47eda54a494ceb1cd922ee6b434b13fb409bc962547706582c256d4b0a2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "90007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1100/90007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cb981d6f272f807a7ec0c6f",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "运动之秋啊……\r\n爸爸他每年都会开拳击体验教室，\r\n我也经常帮忙呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "59cc08d388369af6cb4d54099ce4b33babb2594099b44afe6c6bba4c923ef5c4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "90008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1100/90008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5c35ed36cc0022316a80d2e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天气变冷了呢……\r\n必须好好注意身体才行，\r\n再来多做一点蜂蜜白萝卜吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c017f92a63132cc7d1437a4378f43a6ac81108b46c492a44b48d27b8165c3a9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "90009"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1100/90009"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9276db0ea640b26bcf7d75dc",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "577328317f3e8f6754a3c842ae2cf47257a163c38fddf4ae41c8c796fd51450d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "90020"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1100/90020"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f87facc1402d7b29ce3e2a8b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我前阵子买了新的训练服。\r\n爸爸给我推荐了一套\r\n吸水性很强的喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ef263ad85ace28e89b03d1d874f788fd2c0da71b15357eaff36c8dd72bf400d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "91000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1100/91000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77e93800041241e83f11f46c",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我喜欢妖怪的故事。\r\n只要我一讲起妖怪故事，\r\n歌剧就会显得很感兴趣呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92ab329b85823d95930d3d2c4d44de5bac20edf22ee249fb8714d3ea199fa333",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "91001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1100/91001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:697995bdbb719be9a4be460f",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不介意的话，晚点要不要\r\n一起吃北寄贝咖哩？\r\n是我和小火山一起做的喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "f096d4f2d48432215acb11bff4ef4e7af94986e0ca321a4a1c419c66f51cc3cc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "91002"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1100/91002"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bf840176607a4ffae95fb30",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小历前阵子有教我怎么做\r\n红豆馅松饼～\r\n我最近很喜欢呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe3d04c4e58b4285215497b698667277801f4e54c55a968e1e91b4806d5bb8ef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "91003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1100/91003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52f150e5d9f9fdffb263c987",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "妈妈是个不管做什么事情，\r\n都会一点一滴累积努力的人唷～\r\n她是我的目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcd32b422af02ca6636db3b15d5c1a24564627d2f1aa0ffbc123c499fa36e486",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "91004"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1100/91004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59e69e5864e09d2ff0a2b193",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "「演唱会」有许多很快很难的舞步。\r\n为了能在舞台上好好表现，\r\n我必须努力练习。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7e1d3f0c74cd4c82dcba27891c5208537908e0cd7ff6268a8ee928d0fd0ff5a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "91005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1100/91005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:551d80f8116c6b59ada63361",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然这件衣服很可爱，\r\n但肚肚会觉得有点凉凉的呢～\r\n是不是该先煮些姜茶比较好呀？",
      "source_fingerprint": "124a2324807211d2344a28d8d243fad119e2da06d24423685ef18d6ba051358c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "91006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1100/91006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30705b00527ad668a57eeb4b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这件决胜服的袖子和裙子\r\n都轻飘飘的～\r\n非常好活动呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "efbd9ffbbd0c69eea4cc25de5e298972b8703afd277200611722b12512a99c0a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "91007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1100/91007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bc761b1b05777ad1846777a",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我特别喜欢下襬这些可爱的\r\n菱形图案。只要一换上这件衣服，\r\n就会立刻变得非常有干劲唷～",
      "source_fingerprint": "84ba46dc9139ea5ee28c562759094eb554f1d2f39ca6d06e3f85e9a72ae6fcd4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "91008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1100/91008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bdf5398b6a0ded3c047d8c8",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "早起很棒唷。早上很安静，\r\n不仅慢跑时很容易集中精神，\r\n空气也很清澈呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cf296dfc813fae9d43ecfbbb35a03ada5ddc3ed6a6140cfe334af8e090b9876",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "91009"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1100/91009"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c29789be3b2cb938c77f9e48",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "宿舍餐厅的菜单上有卤萝卜～\r\n味道甜甜辣辣的，非常好吃呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5c540d56e2307df27c67aea809ca858a08fc9673d65488138c82146ca95ce5d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "91010"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1100/91010"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e65ca744323f2e0c46d507a6",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果晚上睡不着，\r\n我推荐喝加了蜂蜜的热牛奶喔。\r\n等身体变得暖暖的，就会想睡了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f10b2af13cf65063527fbeccb0fa8a4ba262fd72f76cc9cd237df4e1fb2ca0c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "91011"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1100/91011"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b98035e325b42bd8361cf7e2",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我前阵子做了柏饼分给大家。\r\n其中小历吃得特别开心呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8c8f5d60c719f9ec532fd533dd1f782308ef27cf413f849851f8b6ccdc2636d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "91012"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1100/91012"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2884d376290a06f7cce31496",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏天很须要补充盐分～\r\n我在训练的空档分送米糠腌菜时，\r\n大家都很开心呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc8e06f1e12901c104fe297233b05340ef8feac4792bf24173623e89396f7563",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "91013"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1100/91013"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d035eb485f01f7041539a956",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "柿子可以有效预防感冒。\r\n现在开始做柿饼，等天气变冷，\r\n是不是就可以吃了呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b62f16447d44b9553e5063d57213c203f734523992d94bf58b6dc60bea58784",
